@startuml

!include components/kampela.puml

[Application] --> [Display driver] : bitmap screen
[Touchscreen driver] --> [Application] : touch event
[Application] --> [Memory access manager] : RAM r/w request
[Application] ---> [Memory access manager] : Application persistent storage access request
[Memory access manager] --> [Application] : Data response
[System monitor] -> [Display driver] : Keepalive indication frame
[Display driver] --> Screen
Touch --> [Touchscreen driver]
[External RAM driver] <--> RAM
[Flash driver] <--> Flash
"NFC Rx" --> "NFC collector"
Seeds -up-> [Cryptography conveyor] : Decoding
[Application] --> [Cryptography conveyor]
[NFC collector] --> [External RAM driver]
[External RAM driver] --> [Cryptography conveyor]
[Cryptography conveyor] -up--> [Display driver]

@enduml

